# ==============================================================================
# Ego Hygiene - Universal puppet-lint Configuration
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Enforce Puppet's recommended language style across first-party manifests.
#
# Notes:
#   - puppet-lint checks style, not Puppet syntax.
#   - Syntax validation should separately use `puppet parser validate`.
#   - Autoloader layout is disabled because this repository can contain Puppet
#     fixtures and examples outside a conventional Puppet module tree.
#
# References:
#   https://github.com/puppetlabs/puppet-lint
#   https://www.puppet.com/docs/puppet/latest/style_guide.html
# ==============================================================================

--fail-on-warnings
--with-filename
--no-autoloader_layout-check
